<div class="player-bar" id="player-bar" aria-label="视频工具栏">
  <div class="controls">
    <div class="media-actions" id="media-actions">
      <button
        class="control"
        type="button"
        id="play-button"
        aria-label="暂停背景视频"
      >
        <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <use href="#i-pause" />
        </svg>
      </button>
      <button
        class="control"
        type="button"
        id="sound-button"
        aria-label="取消静音"
        aria-pressed="false"
      >
        <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <use href="#i-muted" />
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <button
      class="control"
      type="button"
      id="view-button"
      aria-label="隐藏界面"
      aria-pressed="false"
    >
      <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <use href="#i-eye-off" />
      </svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="media-note" id="media-note" role="status" hidden></div>
<dialog
  class="origin-dialog"
  id="hostloc-dialog"
  aria-labelledby="hostloc-title"
  aria-describedby="hostloc-copy"
>
  <button
    class="origin-close"
    id="hostloc-close"
    type="button"
    aria-label="关闭来源提示"
  >
    <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <use href="#i-close" />
    </svg>
  </button>
  <p class="origin-kicker">A NOTE FOR HOSTLOC VISITORS</p>
  <h2 id="hostloc-title">来自 HostLoc 的朋友，你好</h2>
  <div id="hostloc-copy">
    <p>看起来你是从 HostLoc 来到本站的?</p>
    <p>
      如果你是从一个名为 DMengbi 的东西的签名过来, 那么请知悉, 牠并不是本站站长,
      也并未和本站站长相识, 只是一个拙劣的抹黑!
    </p>
    <p>不过感谢送来的流量喔~</p>
  </div>
  <button class="origin-confirm" id="hostloc-confirm" type="button" autofocus>
    我知道了，继续浏览
  </button>
</dialog>
